      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Any guide for migrating a Unity Project from BiRP to URP mentions changes to  shaders. I think Beat Saber can provide a URP beta branch because they're not trying to load shaders from Worlds/Avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
